// Oriole Sedan body: the mid-90s imported midsize sedan.
//
// Intent: clean, low and quietly rounded. A low hood between slim flush lamps with a thin
// slot grille, a raked windshield, a light greenhouse with thin pillars, a smooth arched
// roof, a short high deck with wide tail lamps across it, smooth body-colored bumpers, a
// fine body-side molding and plain alloys. Generic period cues only.
//
